.PS
# basic/truic.cir drawn: no source at all — .tran uic starts from the
# stored energy, C1 charged to 2 V and L1 carrying 1 mA, and the
# network rings down through R1 and R2. Card order kept; deck nodes
# 1 Vc, 2 Vl.
spice = 1
Vc: (1.1,2)
Vl: (2.5,2)

C1: capacitor((0.3,2), (0.3,0), 1u ic=2)
R1: resistor((1.1,2), (1.1,0), 1k)
L1: inductor((1.1,2), (2.5,2), 1m ic=1m)
R2: resistor((2.5,2), (2.5,0), 50)

line from C1.P to R1.P
line from C1.N to R2.N
dot at Vc; dot at R1.N
ground((1.8,0))
.tran 2u 3m uic
.PE
